استخدام MCP Tools للتحكم التلقائي في المصادقة وتحميل الأدوات"},"definition":{"en":"buildbuddy is a remote build execution and CI debugging tool utilizing MCP tools via Context Forge for efficient build management.","zh":"BuildBuddy 是一种 AI 工具，用于远程构建执行和 CI 调试","ja":"BuildBuddy は AI エージェントであり、リモートビルド実行と CI デバッグに使用されます","ko":"BuildBuddy는 AI 에이전트로 원격 빌드 실행 및 CI 디버깅에 사용됩니다","es":"BuildBuddy es una herramienta de AI que permite la ejecución remota de compilaciones y la depuración de pipelines de CI","fr":"BuildBuddy est un outil d''IA qui permet l''exécution distante de builds et le débogage de pipelines de CI","de":"BuildBuddy ist ein AI-Tool, das die Remote-Ausführung von Builds und die Debugging von CI-Pipelines ermöglicht","pt":"O que é BuildBuddy? É uma ferramenta de execução remota de build e depuração de CI que utiliza MCP Tools","ru":"Что такое BuildBuddy? Это инструмент удаленной сборки и отладки CI, который использует MCP Tools для ИИ Агентов","ar":"ما هو BuildBuddy؟ هو أداة لتنفيذ البناء عن بُعد وتصحيح أخطاء CI التي تستخدم MCP Tools"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes MCP tools via Context Forge for authentication","Provides build metadata, status, and duration via buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation","Offers full build logs through buildbuddy-mcp-get-log","Loads tools with ToolSearch query +buildbuddy","Supports remote build execution for streamlined workflows"],"zh":["支持 MCP 工具和 Context Forge","提供构建元数据、状态和持续时间","支持 ToolSearch 查询","支持 buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation 和 buildbuddy-mcp-get-log 工具"],"ja":["MCP ツールと Context Forge をサポート","ビルドメタデータ、ステータス、duration を提供","ToolSearch クエリをサポート","buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation と buildbuddy-mcp-get-log ツールをサポート"],"ko":["MCP 툴 및 Context Forge 지원","빌드 메타데이터, 상태, duration 제공","ToolSearch 쿼리 지원","buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation 및 buildbuddy-mcp-get-log 툴 지원"],"es":["Ejecución remota de compilaciones con herramientas de MCP","Depuración de pipelines de CI con metadatos de compilación","Autenticación automática con herramientas de MCP","Obtención de metadatos de compilación con `buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation`","Obtención de registros de compilación con `buildbuddy-mcp-get-log`"],"fr":["Exécution distante de builds avec les outils de MCP","Débogage de pipelines de CI avec des métadonnées de build","Authentification automatique avec les outils de MCP","Obtention de métadonnées de build avec `buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation`","Obtention de journaux de build avec `buildbuddy-mcp-get-log`"],"de":["Remote-Ausführung von Builds mit MCP-Tools","Debugging von CI-Pipelines mit Build-Metadaten","Automatisierte Authentifizierung mit MCP-Tools","Abruf von Build-Metadaten mit `buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation`","Abruf von Build-Logs mit `buildbuddy-mcp-get-log`"],"pt":["Execução remota de build","Depuração de CI","Autenticação automática com MCP Tools","Metadados de build e status","Duração da build","Carregamento de ferramentas com ToolSearch"],"ru":["Удаленная сборка","Отладка CI","Автоматизация аутентификации с помощью MCP Tools","Метаданные сборки и статус","Продолжительность сборки","Загрузка инструментов с помощью ToolSearch для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["تنفيذ البناء عن بُعد","تصحيح أخطاء CI","التحكم التلقائي في المصادقة مع MCP Tools","بيانات البناء والحالة","مدة البناء","تحميل الأدوات مع ToolSearch"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use buildbuddy","buildbuddy setup guide","buildbuddy alternative","buildbuddy vs Jenkins","remote build execution","CI debugging tools","buildbuddy install","MCP tools for build management"],"zh":["BuildBuddy","远程构建执行","CI 调试","MCP 工具","Context Forge","AI 工具","构建元数据","ToolSearch"],"ja":["BuildBuddy","リモートビルド実行","CI デバッグ","MCP ツール","Context Forge","AI エージェント","ビルドメタデータ","ToolSearch"],"ko":["BuildBuddy","원격 빌드 실행","CI 디버깅","MCP 툴","Context Forge","AI 에이전트","빌드 메타데이터","ToolSearch"],"es":["BuildBuddy","ejecución remota de compilaciones","depuración de CI","herramientas de MCP","autenticación automática","metadatos de compilación","registros de compilación","pipeline de CI"],"fr":["BuildBuddy","exécution distante de builds","débogage de CI","outils de MCP","authentification automatique","métadonnées de build","journaux de build","pipeline de CI"],"de":["BuildBuddy","Remote-Ausführung von Builds","Debugging von CI","MCP-Tools","automatisierte Authentifizierung","Build-Metadaten","Build-Logs","CI-Pipeline"],"pt":["BuildBuddy","execução remota de build","depuração de CI","MCP Tools","autenticação automática","metadados de build","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["BuildBuddy","удаленная сборка","отладка CI","MCP Tools","автоматизация аутентификации","метаданные сборки","инструменты для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["BuildBuddy","تنفيذ البناء عن بُعد","تصحيح أخطاء CI","MCP Tools","التحكم التلقائي في المصادقة","بيانات البناء","أدوات تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"jomcgi","repo":"homelab","repoPath":"jomcgi/homelab","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T00:40:57Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"buildbuddy","description":"Use when debugging failed CI/CD jobs, analyzing build logs, or investigating GitHub Actions failures. Access BuildBuddy remote build execution and caching service for detailed build insights.","bodyPreview":"# BuildBuddy - Remote Build Execution & CI Debugging\n\n## MCP Tools (Primary Interface)\n\nUse BuildBuddy MCP tools via Context Forge. MCP handles authentication automatically.\n\nLoad tools with: `ToolSearch` query `+buildbuddy`\n\n| Tool                              | Purpose                            |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation`   | Build metadata, status, duration   |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-get-log`          | Full build","body":"# BuildBuddy - Remote Build Execution & CI Debugging\n\n## MCP Tools (Primary Interface)\n\nUse BuildBuddy MCP tools via Context Forge. MCP handles authentication automatically.\n\nLoad tools with: `ToolSearch` query `+buildbuddy`\n\n| Tool                              | Purpose                            |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation`   | Build metadata, status, duration   |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-get-log`          | Full build logs (stdout/stderr)    |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-get-target`       | Target information and results     |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-get-action`       | Action details and execution info  |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-get-file`         | Download files by URI              |\n| `buildbuddy-mcp-execute-workflow` | Trigger a BuildBuddy workflow      |\n\n## Debugging Failed CI\n\n### Workflow\n\n```\nGitHub PR fails\n      │\n      ▼\ngh pr checks ──► extract invocation ID from BuildBuddy URL\n      │\n      ▼\nToolSearch +buildbuddy ──► load MCP tools\n      │\n      ▼\nbuildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation ──► check success/failure, duration\n      │\n      ▼\nbuildbuddy-mcp-get-log ──► find error messages\n      │\n      ▼\nParse errors ──► fix root cause\n```\n\n### Step 1: Get the Invocation ID\n\n```bash\n# Extract invocation ID from PR check links\ngh pr checks --json link | jq -r ''.[] | select(.link | contains(\"buildbuddy\")) | .link'' | grep -o ''[^/]*$'' | head -1\n```\n\nThe invocation ID is the last path segment of the BuildBuddy URL:\n`https://jomcgi.buildbuddy.io/invocation/<invocation_id>`\n\n### Step 2: Investigate with MCP Tools\n\nUse the invocation ID with MCP tools — no API key or curl needed:\n\n1. **Get overview:** `buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation` — check `.invocation.success`, command, duration\n2. **Get logs:** `buildbuddy-mcp-get-log` — search for error/fail/fatal messages\n3. **Get targets:** `buildbuddy-mcp-get-target` — find which targets failed\n4. **Get actions:** `buildbuddy-mcp-get-action` — dig into specific action failures\n5. **Get files:** `buildbuddy-mcp-get-file` — download test outputs or artifacts\n\n## Tips\n\n- Reproduce locally with `bazel test //... --config=ci`\n- BuildBuddy logs may be paginated — use page tokens for large logs\n- Check `.invocation.success` boolean to quickly determine pass/fail\n- A PreToolUse hook blocks direct `curl` to the BuildBuddy API — use MCP tools instead\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:55:34.972Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CI/CD Agents requiring streamlined remote build execution and debugging capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要简化远程构建执行和调试功能的CI/CD代理。","ja":"CI/CDエージェントがストリームライン化されたリモートビルドの実行とデバッグ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"원활한 원격 빌드 실행 및 디버깅 기능을 필요로 하는 CI/CD 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que requieren una ejecución de construcción remota optimizada y capacidades de depuración.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents CI/CD nécessitant une exécution de construction à distance simplifiée et des capacités de débogage.","de":"Ideal für CI/CD-Agents, die eine optimierte Remote-Build-Ausführung und Debugging-Funktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de CI/CD que exigem execução de compilação remota simplificada e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально для агентов CI/CD, требующих упрощенного удаленного выполнения сборки и возможностей отладки.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل CI/CD التي تتطلب تنفيذ بناء بعيد مبسط وقدرات تحليل الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage BuildBuddy''s MCP tools for seamless authentication and access to build metadata, status, and duration via buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation, as well as full build logs through buildbuddy-mcp-get-log, utilizing Context Forge for effortless integration.","zh":"赋予代理使用BuildBuddy的MCP工具进行无缝身份验证和访问构建元数据、状态和持续时间的能力，通过buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation，以及通过buildbuddy-mcp-get-log获取完整的构建日志，利用Context Forge实现轻松集成。","ja":"エージェントがBuildBuddyのMCPツールを活用して、buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocationを介してビルドのメタデータ、ステータス、期間へのシームレスな認証とアクセスを実現し、buildbuddy-mcp-get-logを介してビルドログを取得し、Context Forgeを活用してエフォートレスな統合を実現することができます。","ko":"에이전트가 BuildBuddy의 MCP 도구를 사용하여 buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation을 통해 빌드 메타데이터, 상태 및 기간에 대한无缝 인증 및 액세스를 가능하게 하고, buildbuddy-mcp-get-log를 통해 전체 빌드 로그를 얻으며, Context Forge를 통해 노력 없는 통합을 구현할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las herramientas MCP de BuildBuddy para una autenticación y acceso sin problemas a los metadatos de la construcción, estado y duración a través de buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation, así como registros de construcción completos a través de buildbuddy-mcp-get-log, utilizando Context Forge para una integración sin esfuerzo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les outils MCP de BuildBuddy pour une authentification et un accès sans problème aux métadonnées de construction, état et durée via buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation, ainsi que des journaux de construction complets via buildbuddy-mcp-get-log, en utilisant Context Forge pour une intégration sans effort.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, BuildBuddys MCP-Tools für eine nahtlose Authentifizierung und Zugriff auf Build-Metadaten, Status und Dauer über buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation sowie vollständige Build-Logs über buildbuddy-mcp-get-log zu nutzen, unter Einsatz von Context Forge für eine mühelose Integration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar as ferramentas MCP do BuildBuddy para autenticação transparente e acesso a metadados de compilação, status e duração via buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation, bem como logs de compilação completos por meio do buildbuddy-mcp-get-log, utilizando Context Forge para integração sem esforço.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать инструменты MCP BuildBuddy для бесшовной аутентификации и доступа к метаданным сборки, статусу и продолжительности через buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation, а также полные журналы сборки через buildbuddy-mcp-get-log, используя Context Forge для безусильной интеграции.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء باستخدام أدوات MCP من BuildBuddy للتحقق من الصحة الشفافة والوصول إلى بيانات بناء البيانات و الحالة و المدة عبر buildbuddy-mcp-get-invocation، وكذلك سجلات بناء كاملة من خلال buildbuddy-mcp-get-log، باستخدام Context Forge لتكامل بدون جهد."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging remote build failures","Automating build status tracking","Retrieving detailed build logs for analysis"],"zh":["远程构建故障调试","自动构建状态跟踪","检索详细构建日志以进行分析"],"ja":["リモートビルドの障害対応","ビルド状態の自動追跡","詳細なビルドログの取得と分析"],"ko":["원격 빌드 실패 디버깅","자동 빌드 상태 추적","詳細한 빌드 로그를 검색하여 분석"],"es":["Depuración de errores de construcción remota","Automatización del seguimiento del estado de la construcción","Recuperación de registros de construcción detallados para análisis"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de construction à distance","Automatisation du suivi de l''état de la construction","Récupération de journaux de construction détaillés pour analyse"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Remote-Build-Fehlern","Automatisierung der Build-Status-Überwachung","Abruf detaillierter Build-Logs für die Analyse"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de compilação remota","Automatização de acompanhamento de status de compilação","Recuperação de logs de compilação detalhados para análise"],"ru":["Отладка удаленных сборочных сбоев","Автоматизация отслеживания статуса сборки","Получение подробных журналов сборки для анализа"],"ar":["تحليل الأخطاء في عمليات البناء البعيدة","تأتمة تتبع حالة البناء","استرجاع سجلات بناء مفصلة للتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Context Forge integration","Limited to BuildBuddy''s MCP tools and services"],"zh":["需要Context Forge集成","仅限BuildBuddy的MCP工具和服务"],"ja":["Context Forgeの統合が必要","BuildBuddyのMCPツールとサービスに限定"],"ko":["Context Forge 통합이 필요","BuildBuddy의 MCP 도구 및 서비스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con Context Forge","Limitado a las herramientas y servicios MCP de BuildBuddy"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Context Forge","Limité aux outils et services MCP de BuildBuddy"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Context Forge","Begrenzt auf BuildBuddys MCP-Tools und -Dienste"],"pt":["Exige integração com Context Forge","Limitado às ferramentas e serviços MCP do BuildBuddy"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Context Forge","Ограничен инструментами и услугами MCP BuildBuddy"],"ar":["يتطلب تكامل مع Context Forge","محدود بأدوات وخدمات MCP من BuildBuddy"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"d31a4ed85af09d3fd32ea2bfc960ee2bec1d9a42ac6e18c1f6bfb37580453df4","qualityScore":45}');
