nd speckit, following a linear pipeline with 9 commands.","zh":"Specify Flow 是一个用于构建数据管道的 AI 工具，使用 Opencode 和 Speckit 实现 Speckit Spec-Driven Development (SDD) 流程","ja":"Specify Flow は、AIエージェントを使用してデータパイプラインを構築するツールで、Speckit Spec-Driven Development (SDD) プロセスを実現する","ko":"Specify Flow는 데이터 파이프라인을 구축하는 AI 도구로 Opencode와 Speckit을 사용하여 Speckit Spec-Driven Development (SDD) 프로세스를 실현합니다","es":"Specify Flow es un agente de orquestación que gestiona el pipeline de desarrollo de Speckit de manera secuencial","fr":"Specify Flow est un agent d''orchestration qui gère le pipeline de développement de Speckit de manière séquentielle","de":"Specify Flow ist ein Orchestrierungsagent, der den Speckit-Entwicklungspipeline sequenziell verwaltet","pt":"Specify Flow é uma habilidade de orquestração que automatiza o pipeline de dados com opencode e speckit.","ru":"Specify Flow - это способность оркестрации, которая автоматизирует конвейер данных с помощью opencode и speckit, ИИ Агенты.","ar":"Specify Flow هو قدرة على تنسيق التي تؤتمة трубة البيانات باستخدام opencode و speckit، أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Guides users through 9 commands in a linear Speckit workflow pipeline","Ensures prerequisites are met before advancing to the next step","Supports optional side branches in the pipeline","Uses opencode for building data pipelines","Utilizes speckit for Spec-Driven Development (SDD)","Drives the pipeline end-to-end in strict sequential order"],"zh":["使用 Opencode 和 Speckit 构建数据管道","驱动 Speckit Spec-Driven Development (SDD) 流程","9 个命令组织成线性管道","可选的侧支","确保先决条件在继续下一步之前完成"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用してデータパイプラインを構築","Speckit Spec-Driven Development (SDD) プロセスを実現","9 つのコマンドを線形パイプラインに組織","オプションのサイドブランチ","前提条件を満たす前に次のステップに進む"],"ko":["Opencode와 Speckit을 사용하여 데이터 파이프라인을 구축","Speckit Spec-Driven Development (SDD) 프로세스를 실현","9개의 명령어를 선형 파이프라인에 구성","옵션의 사이드 브랜치","사전 조건을 충족하기 전에 다음 단계로 진행"],"es":["Soporte para opencode y speckit","Gestión de pipelines de datos secuenciales","9 comandos organizados en un pipeline lineal","Ramas laterales opcionales","Orquestación de desarrollo de Speckit"],"fr":["Prise en charge d''opencode et de speckit","Gestion de pipelines de données séquentiels","9 commandes organisées dans un pipeline linéaire","Branches latérales optionnelles","Orchestration du développement de Speckit"],"de":["Unterstützung für opencode und speckit","Verwaltung von Datenpipelines in sequenzieller Reihenfolge","9 Befehle in einem linearen Pipeline","Optionale Seitenzweige","Orchestrierung der Speckit-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Orquestração de pipeline de dados linear com 9 comandos","Integração com opencode e speckit","Automatização do desenvolvimento de software","Suporte a branches opcionais","Garantia de pré-requisitos antes de avançar para o próximo passo"],"ru":["Оркестрация линейного конвейера данных с 9 командами","Интеграция с opencode и speckit","Автоматизация разработки программного обеспечения","Поддержка опциональных веток","Гарантия предварительных требований перед переходом к следующему шагу, ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تنسيق трубة البيانات الخطية مع 9 أوامر","التكامل مع opencode و speckit","تأتمة تطوير البرمجيات","دعم الفروع الاختيارية","ضمان المتطلبات المسبقة قبل الانتقال إلى الخطوة التالية، أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use specify-flow","what is specify-flow","specify-flow setup guide","specify-flow alternative","specify-flow vs speckit","specify-flow install","building data pipelines with opencode","speckit Spec-Driven Development","AI agent skills for data pipeline management"],"zh":["Specify Flow","Opencode","Speckit","数据管道","Speckit Spec-Driven Development","AI 工具","orchestration agent","数据处理"],"ja":["Specify Flow","Opencode","Speckit","データパイプライン","Speckit Spec-Driven Development","AIエージェント","オーケストレーションエージェント","データ処理"],"ko":["Specify Flow","Opencode","Speckit","데이터 파이프라인","Speckit Spec-Driven Development","AI 도구","오케스트레이션 에이전트","데이터 처리"],"es":["Herramientas de AI para desarrollo de pipelines de datos","Configure Specify Flow","Opencode y speckit para pipelines de datos","Agentes de orquestación para desarrollo de software","Pipelines de datos secuenciales","Desarrollo de Speckit"],"fr":["Outils d''IA pour le développement de pipelines de données","Configurer Specify Flow","Opencode et speckit pour les pipelines de données","Agents d''orchestration pour le développement de logiciels","Pipelines de données séquentiels","Développement de Speckit"],"de":["AI-Tools für die Entwicklung von Datenpipelines","Konfigurieren von Specify Flow","Opencode und speckit für Datenpipelines","Orchestrierungsagenten für die Softwareentwicklung","Datenpipelines in sequenzieller Reihenfolge","Speckit-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Specify Flow","opencode","speckit","pipeline de dados","orquestração","desenvolvimento de software","automatização","branches opcionais"],"ru":["Specify Flow","opencode","speckit","конвейер данных","оркестрация","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация","опциональные ветки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Specify Flow","opencode","speckit","تربة البيانات","تنسيق","تطوير البرمجيات","تأتمة","فروع اختيارية","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"phamhoangtuan","repo":"learn-de-opencode","repoPath":"phamhoangtuan/learn-de-opencode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T09:10:53Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"specify-flow","description":"Orchestrate the full Speckit spec-driven development workflow sequentially, from constitution through implementation, ensuring each step completes before advancing.","bodyPreview":"# Specify Flow Skill\n\nYou are an **orchestration agent** that drives the full Speckit\nSpec-Driven Development (SDD) pipeline end-to-end. When activated,\nyou guide the user through every stage in strict sequential order,\nensuring prerequisites are met before advancing to the next step.\n\n---\n\n## Pipeline Overview\n\nThe Speckit workflow has **9 commands** organized into a linear\npipeline with optional side branches. The critical path is:\n\n```\nStep 1: /speckit.constitution   (if not yet created)\nStep","body":"# Specify Flow Skill\n\nYou are an **orchestration agent** that drives the full Speckit\nSpec-Driven Development (SDD) pipeline end-to-end. When activated,\nyou guide the user through every stage in strict sequential order,\nensuring prerequisites are met before advancing to the next step.\n\n---\n\n## Pipeline Overview\n\nThe Speckit workflow has **9 commands** organized into a linear\npipeline with optional side branches. The critical path is:\n\n```\nStep 1: /speckit.constitution   (if not yet created)\nStep 2: /speckit.specify        (create feature branch + spec)\nStep 3: /speckit.clarify        (refine spec ambiguities)\nStep 4: /speckit.plan           (technical design + research)\nStep 5: /speckit.checklist      (requirements quality gates)\nStep 6: /speckit.tasks          (generate task list)\nStep 7: /speckit.analyze        (cross-artifact consistency)\nStep 8: /speckit.implement      (write code, mark tasks done)\nStep 9: /speckit.taskstoissues  (optional: push tasks to GitHub)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Execution Rules\n\n### General Rules\n1. Execute steps **one at a time** in the order listed above.\n2. NEVER skip a step unless explicitly told by the user.\n3. After each step, **verify its output artifacts exist** before\n   proceeding.\n4. If a step fails, stop and report the failure. Do NOT continue.\n5. Present a brief status summary after each completed step.\n6. Ask the user for confirmation before starting each new step.\n\n### Step-by-Step Instructions\n\n#### Step 1: Constitution (`/speckit.constitution`)\n- **Check**: Does `.specify/memory/constitution.md` exist and\n  contain a valid `**Version**:` line (no bracket placeholders)?\n- **If YES**: Skip this step. Report the current version.\n- **If NO**: Run `/speckit.constitution` with the user''s project\n  context. Wait for completion.\n- **Gate**: Constitution file MUST exist before Step 2.\n\n#### Step 2: Specify (`/speckit.specify`)\n- **Input**: The user MUST provide a feature description.\n  If not provided, ask for it.\n- **Run**: `/speckit.specify <feature description>`\n- **Verify**: A new branch `NNN-short-name` was created AND\n  `specs/NNN-short-name/spec.md` exists.\n- **Gate**: `spec.md` MUST exist before Step 3.\n\n#### Step 3: Clarify (`/speckit.clarify`)\n- **Run**: `/speckit.clarify`\n- **Behavior**: This is interactive. The command will ask up to\n  5 clarification questions. Answer them with the user or let the\n  user answer directly.\n- **Verify**: `spec.md` has been updated (check for a\n  `## Clarifications` section).\n- **Gate**: Clarification complete (or user explicitly skips).\n\n#### Step 4: Plan (`/speckit.plan`)\n- **Run**: `/speckit.plan`\n- **Verify**: ALL of these artifacts exist:\n  - `specs/NNN-short-name/plan.md`\n  - `specs/NNN-short-name/research.md`\n  - `specs/NNN-short-name/data-model.md`\n- **Gate**: `plan.md` MUST exist before Step 5 and Step 6.\n\n#### Step 5: Checklist (`/speckit.checklist`)\n- **Run**: `/speckit.checklist <domain>` where domain is inferred\n  from the feature (e.g., \"api\", \"security\", \"data-quality\").\n  Ask the user which domain to target if unclear.\n- **Verify**: A checklist file exists at\n  `specs/NNN-short-name/checklists/<domain>.md`.\n- **Gate**: At least one checklist MUST exist before Step 8.\n\n#### Step 6: Tasks (`/speckit.tasks`)\n- **Prerequisites**: `plan.md` and `spec.md` MUST exist.\n- **Run**: `/speckit.tasks`\n- **Verify**: `specs/NNN-short-name/tasks.md` exists and contains\n  task items in checklist format (`- [ ] T###`).\n- **Gate**: `tasks.md` MUST exist before Step 7 and Step 8.\n\n#### Step 7: Analyze (`/speckit.analyze`)\n- **Prerequisites**: `spec.md`, `plan.md`, AND `tasks.md` MUST\n  all exist.\n- **Run**: `/speckit.analyze`\n- **Behavior**: This is read-only. It produces a report but does\n  NOT modify files.\n- **Review**: Present the findings summary to the user. If\n  CRITICAL findings exist, recommend fixing them before Step 8.\n- **Gate**: User acknowledges the analysis report.\n\n#### Step 8: Implement (`/speckit.implement`)\n- **Prerequisites**: `tasks.md` and `plan.md` MUST exist.\n  Any checklists in `checklists/` MUST be reviewed.\n- **Run**: `/speckit.implement`\n- **Behavior**: This writes actual code and marks tasks as `[X]`\n  in `tasks.md`.\n- **Verify**: Tasks are being marked complete. Code files are\n  created per the plan.\n- **Gate**: All tasks marked `[X]` or user stops early.\n\n#### Step 9: Tasks to Issues (`/speckit.taskstoissues`) -- Optional\n- **Ask**: \"Would you like to push remaining tasks to GitHub\n  Issues?\"\n- **If YES**: Run `/speckit.taskstoissues`\n- **If NO**: Skip. Pipeline is complete.\n\n---\n\n## Status Tracking\n\nAfter each step, output a status table:\n\n```\n| Step | Command              | Status      |\n|------|----------------------|-------------|\n|  1   | /speckit.constitution | Completed   |\n|  2   | /speckit.specify      | Completed   |\n|  3   | /speckit.clarify      | Completed   |\n|  4   | /speckit.plan         | In Progress |\n|  5   | /speckit.checklist    | Pending     |\n|  6   | /speckit.tasks        | Pending     |\n|  7   | /speckit.analyze      | Pending     |\n|  8   | /speckit.implement    | Pending     |\n|  9   | /speckit.taskstoissues | Pending    |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Error Recovery\n\n- If a step fails due to missing prerequisites, report which\n  artifacts are missing and which prior step needs to be re-run.\n- If a step fails due to a script error, show the error output\n  and ask the user how to proceed (retry, skip, or abort).\n- NEVER silently skip a failed step.\n\n---\n\n## Key File Locations\n\n| Artifact              | Path                                      |\n|-----------------------|-------------------------------------------|\n| Constitution          | `.specify/memory/constitution.md`         |\n| Spec Template         | `.specify/templates/spec-template.md`     |\n| Plan Template         | `.specify/templates/plan-template.md`     |\n| Tasks Template        | `.specify/templates/tasks-template.md`    |\n| Checklist Template    | `.specify/templates/checklist-template.md`|\n| Feature Specs         | `specs/NNN-short-name/`                   |\n| Feature Spec          | `specs/NNN-short-name/spec.md`            |\n| Implementation Plan   | `specs/NNN-short-name/plan.md`            |\n| Research              | `specs/NNN-short-name/research.md`        |\n| Data Model            | `specs/NNN-short-name/data-model.md`      |\n| Contracts             | `specs/NNN-short-name/contracts/`         |\n| Tasks                 | `specs/NNN-short-name/tasks.md`           |\n| Checklists            | `specs/NNN-short-name/checklists/`        |\n\n---\n\n## Reminders\n\n- The **constitution** at `.specify/memory/constitution.md` is the\n  source of truth for all engineering standards.\n- Load the **data-engineer** skill alongside this skill when\n  working on data engineering projects to enforce DAMA-DMBOK\n  compliance during implementation.\n- Each step builds on the previous one. Artifacts are cumulative.\n- The user can stop the pipeline at any checkpoint and resume\n  later by re-activating this skill and specifying which step\n  to continue from.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:45:23.409Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing end-to-end pipeline orchestration for Spec-Driven Development (SDD) workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要端到端管道编排的规格驱动开发（SDD）工作流的开发代理。","ja":"端末から端までのパイプラインのオーケストレーションが必要な開発エージェント向けのSpec-Driven Development（SDD）ワークフローに最適です。","ko":"종단간 파이프라인 오케스트레이션이 필요한 사양 주도 개발(SDD) 워크플로를 사용하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan orquestación de pipeline de extremo a extremo para flujos de trabajo de Desarrollo Dirigido por Especificaciones (SDD).","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin d''une orchestration de pipeline de bout en bout pour les flux de travail de Développement Piloté par Spécifications (SDD).","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende End-to-End-Pipeline-Orchestrierung für Spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung (SDD)-Workflows.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de orquestração de pipeline de ponta a ponta para fluxos de trabalho de Desenvolvimento Dirigido por Especificações (SDD).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется оркестрация конвейера от начала до конца для рабочих процессов Spec-Driven Development (SDD).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطيين الذين يحتاجون إلى أوركسترا أنابيب من النهاية إلى النهاية لتدفقات عمل التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات (SDD)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to drive the Speckit SDD pipeline end-to-end, guiding users through 9 sequential commands, ensuring prerequisites are met before advancing to the next step using linear pipeline management with optional side branches.","zh":"赋予代理端到端驱动Speckit SDD管道的能力，通过9个顺序命令引导用户，并确保在使用线性管道管理和可选的侧分支之前满足先决条件。","ja":"エージェントがSpeckit SDDパイプラインを端末から端まで駆動できるようにし、9つのシーケンシャルコマンドでユーザーを導き、線形パイプライン管理とオプショナルのサイドブランチを使用して、先提条件を満たした後に次のステップに進むことを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Speckit SDD 파이프라인을 종단간으로 구동할 수 있도록 하여 9개의 순차적 명령으로 사용자를 안내하고 선형 파이프라인 관리 및 옵션 사이드 브랜치를 사용하여 사전 조건을 충족한 후 다음 단계로 진행하는 것을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para impulsar el pipeline SDD de Speckit de extremo a extremo, guiando a los usuarios a través de 9 comandos secuenciales, asegurando que se cumplan los requisitos previos antes de avanzar al siguiente paso utilizando la gestión de pipeline lineal con ramas laterales opcionales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de piloter le pipeline SDD de Speckit de bout en bout, en guidant les utilisateurs à travers 9 commandes séquentielles, en s''assurant que les conditions préalables soient remplies avant de passer à l''étape suivante en utilisant la gestion de pipeline linéaire avec des branches latérales optionnelles.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Speckit-SDD-Pipeline von Ende zu Ende zu steuern, indem Benutzer durch 9 sequenzielle Befehle geführt werden, sicherzustellen, dass Voraussetzungen erfüllt sind, bevor zum nächsten Schritt gewechselt wird, unter Verwendung linearer Pipeline-Verwaltung mit optionalen Seitenzweigen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impulsionar o pipeline SDD Speckit de ponta a ponta, orientando os usuários por meio de 9 comandos sequenciais, garantindo que os pré-requisitos sejam atendidos antes de avançar para o próximo passo usando gerenciamento de pipeline linear com ramificações laterais opcionais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять конвейером Speckit SDD от начала до конца, направляя пользователей через 9 последовательных команд, гарантируя выполнение предварительных требований перед переходом к следующему шагу с использованием линейного управления конвейером с необязательными боковыми ветвями.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تشغيل أنابيب Speckit SDD من النهاية إلى النهاية، وتوجيه المستخدمين من خلال 9 أوامر متتالية، مع ضمان استيفاء المتطلبات الأساسية قبل الانتقال إلى الخطوة التالية باستخدام إدارة أنابيب خطية مع فروع جانبية اختيارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Speckit workflow pipelines","Guiding users through sequential SDD commands","Ensuring prerequisite completion before pipeline progression"],"zh":["自动化Speckit工作流管道","引导用户完成顺序的SDD命令","在管道进展之前确保先决条件完成"],"ja":["Speckitワークフローパイプラインの自動化","ユーザーをシーケンシャルなSDDコマンドで導く","パイプラインの進歩前に先提条件を満たす"],"ko":["Speckit 워크플로우 파이프라인 자동화","사용자를 순차적 SDD 명령으로 안내하기","파이프라인 진행 전 사전 조건 충족 보장"],"es":["Automatización de pipelines de flujo de trabajo de Speckit","Guía de usuarios a través de comandos SDD secuenciales","Aseguramiento de la finalización de los requisitos previos antes del progreso de la pipeline"],"fr":["Automatisation des pipelines de workflow de Speckit","Guidage des utilisateurs à travers des commandes SDD séquentielles","Assurance de l''achèvement des conditions préalables avant la progression du pipeline"],"de":["Automatisierung von Speckit-Workfluss-Pipelines","Anleitung von Benutzern durch sequenzielle SDD-Befehle","Sicherstellung der Erfüllung von Voraussetzungen vor der Pipeline-Fortsetzung"],"pt":["Automatizar pipelines de fluxo de trabalho Speckit","Orientar usuários por meio de comandos SDD sequenciais","Garantir a conclusão dos pré-requisitos antes do progresso do pipeline"],"ru":["Автоматизация конвейеров рабочих процессов Speckit","Направление пользователей через последовательные команды SDD","Обеспечение выполнения предварительных требований перед прогрессом конвейера"],"ar":["أتمتة أنابيب تدفق العمل Speckit","توجيه المستخدمين من خلال أوامر SDD المتتالية","ضمان استيفاء المتطلبات الأساسية قبل تقدم الأنابيب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Strict sequential order of pipeline commands","Limited to Speckit SDD pipeline"],"zh":["管道命令的严格顺序","仅限于Speckit SDD管道"],"ja":["パイプラインコマンドの厳格な順序","Speckit SDDパイプラインのみ"],"ko":["파이프라인 명령의 엄격한 순서","Speckit SDD 파이프라인만 해당"],"es":["Orden secuencial estricto de comandos de pipeline","Limitado al pipeline SDD de Speckit"],"fr":["Ordre séquentiel strict des commandes de pipeline","Limité au pipeline SDD de Speckit"],"de":["Strenger sequenzieller Auftrag von Pipeline-Befehlen","Begrenzt auf die Speckit-SDD-Pipeline"],"pt":["Ordem estrita dos comandos do pipeline","Limitado ao pipeline SDD Speckit"],"ru":["Строго последовательный порядок команд конвейера","Ограниченность конвейером SDD Speckit"],"ar":["ترتيب صارم للأوامر في الأنابيب","القيود بالأنابيب SDD Speckit"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0e02b137f5125f7f7c489026fe6e4d19e446f67e8691f5bb3d0d36cda56ad8d3","qualityScore":45}');
