:"تعلم كيفية إعداد dotnet-cli-release-pipeline لتحسين كفاءة خط أنابيب التطوير .NET الخاص بك مع GitHub Actions و SemVer"},"definition":{"en":"dotnet-cli-release-pipeline is a unified release CI/CD pipeline for .NET CLI tools, automating workflows and generating distribution packages for comprehensive .NET development guidance.","zh":"dotnet-cli-release-pipeline是用于自动化.NET发布流水线的AIエージェント","ja":"dotnet-cli-release-pipelineは、.NETのリリースパイプラインを自動化するためのAIエージェント","ko":"dotnet-cli-release-pipeline는 자동화된 .NET 배포 파이프라인을 구축하는 데 사용되는 AI 도구","es":"Un pipeline de lanzamiento unificado para herramientas de línea de comandos .NET que utiliza GitHub Actions y versionamiento SemVer","fr":"Un pipeline de publication unifié pour les outils .NET CLI qui utilise GitHub Actions et la stratégie de versionning SemVer","de":"Eine einheitliche Release-Pipeline für .NET-CLI-Tools, die GitHub Actions und SemVer-Versionierung verwendet","pt":"O que é dotnet-cli-release-pipeline? É uma ferramenta de automação de pipeline de desenvolvimento .NET que utiliza GitHub Actions e SemVer.","ru":"Что такое конвейер выпуска dotnet-cli-release-pipeline? Это инструмент автоматизации процесса разработки .NET, использующий GitHub Actions и SemVer.","ar":"ما هو dotnet-cli-release-pipeline؟ هو أداة خط أنابيب تطوير .NET التي تستخدم GitHub Actions و SemVer."},"features":{"en":["Produces all distribution formats from a single version tag trigger","Builds matrix per Runtime Identifier (RID) for flexible deployment","Stages artifacts between jobs for efficient workflow management","Creates GitHub Releases with SHA-256 checksums for secure distribution","Automates Homebrew formula and winget manifest PR creation for streamlined package management","Utilizes SemVer versioning strategy with git tags for consistent version control"],"zh":["支持多平台的.zip包和OpenCode npm插件","使用GitHub Actions工作流自动化构建和部署","支持SemVer版本管理和git标签","自动创建Homebrew公式和winget清单PR","支持SHA-256校验和"],"ja":["マルチプラットフォームの.zipパッケージとOpenCode npmプラグインをサポート","GitHub Actionsワークフローを使用した自動化されたビルドとデプロイ","SemVerバージョニングとgitタグをサポート","HomebrewフォーミュラとwingetマニフェストPRの自動作成","SHA-256チェックサムをサポート"],"ko":["다중 플랫폼의 .zip 패키지와 OpenCode npm 플러그인을 지원","GitHub Actions 워크플로를 사용한 자동화된 빌드와 배포","SemVer 버ージョ닝과 git 태그를 지원","Homebrew 공식과 winget 매니페스트 PR의 자동 생성","SHA-256 체크섬을 지원"],"es":["GitHub Actions workflow para producir todos los formatos de distribución","Matriz de compilación por Runtime Identifier (RID)","Etapa de artefactos entre trabajos","Creación automática de fórmulas de Homebrew y manifiestos de winget","Estrategia de versionamiento SemVer con etiquetas de git"],"fr":["Workflow GitHub Actions pour produire tous les formats de distribution","Matrice de build par Runtime Identifier (RID)","Étape d''artefacts entre les travaux","Création automatique de formules Homebrew et de manifestes winget","Stratégie de versionning SemVer avec des balises Git"],"de":["GitHub Actions-Workflow zum Erstellen aller Distributionformate","Build-Matrix pro Laufzeit-Identifikator (RID)","Artefaktstufe zwischen Aufträgen","Automatische Erstellung von Homebrew-Formeln und winget-Manifesten","SemVer-Versionierungsstrategie mit Git-Tags"],"pt":["Suporte a GitHub Actions workflow","Geração de artefatos por Runtime Identifier (RID)","Criação automática de fórmulas Homebrew e manifestos winget","Uso de SemVer para versionamento","Geração de checksums SHA-256 para releases","Integração com GitHub Releases"],"ru":["Поддержка конвейера GitHub Actions","Генерация артефактов по идентификатору среды выполнения (RID)","Автоматическое создание формул Homebrew и манифестов winget","Использование SemVer для версионирования","Генерация checksumов SHA-256 для релизов","Интеграция с GitHub Releases"],"ar":["دعم سير عمل GitHub Actions","إنتاج الملفات المجمعة حسب معرّف وقت التشغيل (RID)","إنشاء صيغ Homebrew وmanifests winget تلقائي","استخدام SemVer للنسخة","إنتاج خوارزمية SHA-256 للنشر","التكامل مع GitHub Releases"]},"keywords":{"en":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline setup guide","how to use dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","what is dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","dotnet-cli-release-pipeline alternative","dotnet-cli-release-pipeline vs azure devops","dotnet-cli-release-pipeline install","dotnet-cli-release-pipeline tutorial","github actions workflow syntax v2","net 8.0+ ci/cd pipeline"],"zh":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","AIエージェント","自动化.NET发布流水线","GitHub Actions","SemVer版本管理","git标签",".NET开发"],"ja":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","AIエージェント",".NETのリリースパイプライン","GitHub Actions","SemVerバージョニング","gitタグ",".NET開発"],"ko":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","AI 도구","자동화된 .NET 배포 파이프라인","GitHub Actions","SemVer 버ージョ닝","git 태그",".NET 개발"],"es":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","herramientas de línea de comandos .NET","GitHub Actions","versionamiento SemVer","desarrollo de .NET","pipeline de lanzamiento","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","Agentes de inteligencia artificial para .NET"],"fr":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","outils .NET CLI","GitHub Actions","versionning SemVer","développement .NET","pipeline de publication","Outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Agents d''intelligence artificielle pour .NET"],"de":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline",".NET-CLI-Tools","GitHub Actions","SemVer-Versionierung",".NET-Entwicklung","Release-Pipeline","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten für .NET"],"pt":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","GitHub Actions","SemVer","desenvolvimento .NET","pipeline de desenvolvimento","automatização de pipeline","Runtime Identifier","Homebrew","winget"],"ru":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","GitHub Actions","SemVer","разработка .NET","конвейер разработки","автоматизация конвейера","Идентификатор среды выполнения","Homebrew","winget","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","GitHub Actions","SemVer","تطوير .NET","خط أنابيب التطوير","آليّة خط أنابيب","معرّف وقت التشغيل","Homebrew","winget","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"rudironsoni","repo":"dotnet-harness-plugin","repoPath":"rudironsoni/dotnet-harness-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T21:33:22Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotnet-cli-release-pipeline","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# dotnet-cli-release-pipeline\n\nUnified release CI/CD pipeline for .NET CLI tools: GitHub Actions workflow producing all distribution formats from a\nsingle version tag trigger, build matrix per Runtime Identifier (RID), artifact staging between jobs, GitHub Releases\nwith SHA-256 checksums, automated Homebrew formula and winget manifest PR creation, and SemVer versioning strategy with\ngit tags.\n\n**Version assumptions:** .NET 8.0+ baseline. GitHub Actions workflow syntax v2. Patterns apply to any C","body":"# dotnet-cli-release-pipeline\n\nUnified release CI/CD pipeline for .NET CLI tools: GitHub Actions workflow producing all distribution formats from a\nsingle version tag trigger, build matrix per Runtime Identifier (RID), artifact staging between jobs, GitHub Releases\nwith SHA-256 checksums, automated Homebrew formula and winget manifest PR creation, and SemVer versioning strategy with\ngit tags.\n\n**Version assumptions:** .NET 8.0+ baseline. GitHub Actions workflow syntax v2. Patterns apply to any CI system but\nexamples use GitHub Actions.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Tag-triggered GitHub Actions release workflow\n- Build matrix per Runtime Identifier (RID)\n- Artifact staging between CI jobs\n- GitHub Releases with SHA-256 checksums\n- Automated Homebrew formula and winget manifest PR creation\n- SemVer versioning with git tags\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- General CI/CD patterns (branch strategies, matrix testing) -- see [skill:dotnet-gha-patterns] and\n  [skill:dotnet-ado-patterns]\n- Native AOT compilation configuration -- see [skill:dotnet-native-aot]\n- Distribution strategy decisions -- see [skill:dotnet-cli-distribution]\n- Package format details -- see [skill:dotnet-cli-packaging]\n- Container image publishing -- see [skill:dotnet-containers]\n\nCross-references: [skill:dotnet-cli-distribution] for RID matrix and publish strategy, [skill:dotnet-cli-packaging] for\npackage format authoring, [skill:dotnet-native-aot] for AOT publish configuration, [skill:dotnet-containers] for\ncontainer-based distribution.\n\n---\n\n## Versioning Strategy\n\n### SemVer + Git Tags\n\nUse Semantic Versioning (SemVer) with git tags as the single source of truth for release versions.\n\n**Tag format:** `v{major}.{minor}.{patch}` (e.g., `v1.2.3`)\n\n````bash\n\n# Tag a release\ngit tag -a v1.2.3 -m \"Release v1.2.3\"\ngit push origin v1.2.3\n\n```bash\n\n### Version Flow\n\n```text\n\ngit tag v1.2.3\n    │\n    ▼\nGitHub Actions trigger (on push tags: v*)\n    │\n    ▼\nExtract version from tag: GITHUB_REF_NAME → v1.2.3 → 1.2.3\n    │\n    ▼\nPass to dotnet publish /p:Version=1.2.3\n    │\n    ▼\nEmbed in binary (--version output)\n    │\n    ▼\nStamp in package manifests (Homebrew, winget, Scoop, NuGet)\n\n```text\n\n### Extracting Version from Tag\n\n```yaml\n\n- name: Extract version from tag\n  id: version\n  run: echo \"version=${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n  # v1.2.3 → 1.2.3\n\n```text\n\n### Pre-release Versions\n\n```bash\n\n# Pre-release tag\ngit tag -a v1.3.0-rc.1 -m \"Release candidate 1\"\n\n# CI detects pre-release and skips package manager submissions\n# but still creates GitHub Release as pre-release\n\n```text\n\n---\n\n## Unified GitHub Actions Workflow\n\n### Complete Workflow\n\n```yaml\n\nname: Release\n\non:\n  push:\n    tags:\n      - ''v[0-9]+.[0-9]+.[0-9]+*'' # v1.2.3, v1.2.3-rc.1\n\npermissions:\n  contents: write # Create GitHub Releases\n\ndefaults:\n  run:\n    shell: bash\n\nenv:\n  PROJECT: src/MyCli/MyCli.csproj\n  DOTNET_VERSION: ''8.0.x''\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        include:\n          - rid: linux-x64\n            os: ubuntu-latest\n          - rid: linux-arm64\n            os: ubuntu-latest\n          - rid: osx-arm64\n            os: macos-latest\n          - rid: win-x64\n            os: windows-latest\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-dotnet@v4\n        with:\n          dotnet-version: ${{ env.DOTNET_VERSION }}\n\n      - name: Extract version\n        id: version\n        shell: bash\n        run: echo \"version=${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n\n      - name: Publish\n        run: >-\n          dotnet publish ${{ env.PROJECT }} -c Release -r ${{ matrix.rid }} -o ./publish /p:Version=${{\n          steps.version.outputs.version }}\n\n      - name: Package (Unix)\n        if: runner.os != ''Windows''\n        run: |\n          set -euo pipefail\n          cd publish\n          tar -czf \"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/mytool-${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}-${{ matrix.rid }}.tar.gz\" .\n\n      - name: Package (Windows)\n        if: runner.os == ''Windows''\n        shell: pwsh\n        run: |\n          Compress-Archive -Path \"publish/*\" `\n            -DestinationPath \"mytool-${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}-${{ matrix.rid }}.zip\"\n\n      - name: Upload artifact\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: release-${{ matrix.rid }}\n          path: |\n            *.tar.gz\n            *.zip\n\n  release:\n    needs: build\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Extract version\n        id: version\n        run: echo \"version=${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n\n      - name: Download all artifacts\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          path: artifacts\n          merge-multiple: true\n\n      - name: Generate checksums\n        working-directory: artifacts\n        run: |\n          set -euo pipefail\n          shasum -a 256 *.tar.gz *.zip > checksums-sha256.txt\n          cat checksums-sha256.txt\n\n      - name: Detect pre-release\n        id: prerelease\n        run: |\n          set -euo pipefail\n          if [[ \"${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\" == *-* ]]; then\n            echo \"is_prerelease=true\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n          else\n            echo \"is_prerelease=false\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n          fi\n\n      # Pin third-party actions to a commit SHA in production for supply-chain security\n      - name: Create GitHub Release\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\n        with:\n          name: v${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\n          prerelease: ${{ steps.prerelease.outputs.is_prerelease }}\n          generate_release_notes: true\n          files: |\n            artifacts/*.tar.gz\n            artifacts/*.zip\n            artifacts/checksums-sha256.txt\n\n  publish-nuget:\n    needs: release\n    if: ${{ !contains(github.ref_name, ''-'') }} # Skip pre-releases\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-dotnet@v4\n        with:\n          dotnet-version: ${{ env.DOTNET_VERSION }}\n\n      - name: Extract version\n        id: version\n        run: echo \"version=${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n\n      - name: Pack\n        run: >-\n          dotnet pack ${{ env.PROJECT }} -c Release /p:Version=${{ steps.version.outputs.version }} -o ./nupkgs\n\n      - name: Push to NuGet\n        run: >-\n          dotnet nuget push ./nupkgs/*.nupkg --source https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json --api-key ${{\n          secrets.NUGET_API_KEY }}\n\n```json\n\n---\n\n## Build Matrix per RID\n\n### Matrix Strategy\n\nThe build matrix produces one artifact per RID. Each RID runs on the appropriate runner OS.\n\n```yaml\n\nstrategy:\n  matrix:\n    include:\n      - rid: linux-x64\n        os: ubuntu-latest\n      - rid: linux-arm64\n        os: ubuntu-latest # Cross-compile ARM64 on x64 runner\n      - rid: osx-arm64\n        os: macos-latest # Native ARM64 runner\n      - rid: win-x64\n        os: windows-latest\n\n```text\n\n### Cross-Compilation Notes\n\n- **linux-arm64 on ubuntu-latest:** .NET supports cross-compilation for managed (non-AOT) builds.\n  `dotnet publish -r linux-arm64` on an x64 runner produces a valid ARM64 binary without QEMU. For Native AOT,\n  cross-compiling ARM64 on an x64 runner requires the ARM64 cross-compilation toolchain (`gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu` or\n  equivalent). See [skill:dotnet-native-aot] for cross-compile prerequisites.\n- **osx-arm64:** Use `macos-latest` (which provides ARM64 runners) for native compilation. Cross-compiling macOS ARM64\n  from Linux is not supported.\n- **win-x64 on windows-latest:** Native compilation on Windows runner.\n\n### Extended Matrix (Optional)\n\n```yaml\n\nstrategy:\n  matrix:\n    include:\n      # Primary targets\n      - rid: linux-x64\n        os: ubuntu-latest\n      - rid: linux-arm64\n        os: ubuntu-latest\n      - rid: osx-arm64\n        os: macos-latest\n      - rid: win-x64\n        os: windows-latest\n      # Extended targets\n      - rid: osx-x64\n        os: macos-13 # Intel macOS runner\n      - rid: linux-musl-x64\n        os: ubuntu-latest # Alpine musl cross-compile\n\n```text\n\n---\n\n## Artifact Staging\n\n### Upload Per-RID Artifacts\n\nEach matrix job uploads its artifact with a RID-specific name:\n\n```yaml\n\n- name: Upload artifact\n  uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n  with:\n    name: release-${{ matrix.rid }}\n    path: |\n      *.tar.gz\n      *.zip\n    retention-days: 1 # Short retention -- artifacts are published to GitHub Releases\n\n```text\n\n### Download in Release Job\n\nThe release job downloads all artifacts from the build matrix:\n\n```yaml\n\n- name: Download all artifacts\n  uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n  with:\n    path: artifacts\n    merge-multiple: true # Merge all release-* artifacts into one directory\n\n```text\n\nAfter download, `artifacts/` contains:\n\n```text\n\nartifacts/\n  mytool-1.2.3-linux-x64.tar.gz\n  mytool-1.2.3-linux-arm64.tar.gz\n  mytool-1.2.3-osx-arm64.tar.gz\n  mytool-1.2.3-win-x64.zip\n\n```text\n\n---\n\n## GitHub Releases with Checksums\n\n### Checksum Generation\n\n```yaml\n\n- name: Generate checksums\n  working-directory: artifacts\n  run: |\n    set -euo pipefail\n    shasum -a 256 *.tar.gz *.zip > checksums-sha256.txt\n    cat checksums-sha256.txt\n\n```text\n\n**Output format (checksums-sha256.txt):**\n\n```text\n\nabc123...  mytool-1.2.3-linux-x64.tar.gz\ndef456...  mytool-1.2.3-linux-arm64.tar.gz\nghi789...  mytool-1.2.3-osx-arm64.tar.gz\njkl012...  mytool-1.2.3-win-x64.zip\n\n```text\n\n### Creating the Release\n\n```yaml\n\n- name: Create GitHub Release\n  uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\n  with:\n    name: v${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\n    prerelease: ${{ steps.prerelease.outputs.is_prerelease }}\n    generate_release_notes: true\n    files: |\n      artifacts/*.tar.gz\n      artifacts/*.zip\n      artifacts/checksums-sha256.txt\n\n```text\n\n`generate_release_notes: true` auto-generates release notes from merged PRs and commit messages since the last tag.\n\n---\n\n## Automated Formula/Manifest PR Creation\n\n### Homebrew Formula Update\n\nAfter the GitHub Release is published, update the Homebrew tap automatically:\n\n```yaml\n\nupdate-homebrew:\n  needs: release\n  if: ${{ !contains(github.ref_name, ''-'') }}\n  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n  steps:\n    - name: Extract version\n      id: version\n      run: echo \"version=${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n\n    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      with:\n        repository: myorg/homebrew-tap\n        token: ${{ secrets.TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n\n    - name: Download checksums\n      run: |\n        set -euo pipefail\n        curl -sL \"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}/checksums-sha256.txt\" \\\n          -o checksums.txt\n\n    - name: Update formula\n      run: |\n        set -euo pipefail\n        VERSION=\"${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\"\n        LINUX_X64_SHA=$(grep \"linux-x64\" checksums.txt | awk ''{print $1}'')\n        LINUX_ARM64_SHA=$(grep \"linux-arm64\" checksums.txt | awk ''{print $1}'')\n        OSX_ARM64_SHA=$(grep \"osx-arm64\" checksums.txt | awk ''{print $1}'')\n\n        # Use sed or a templating script to update Formula/mytool.rb\n        # with new version and SHA-256 values\n        python3 scripts/update-formula.py \\\n          --version \"$VERSION\" \\\n          --linux-x64-sha \"$LINUX_X64_SHA\" \\\n          --linux-arm64-sha \"$LINUX_ARM64_SHA\" \\\n          --osx-arm64-sha \"$OSX_ARM64_SHA\"\n\n    - name: Create PR\n      uses: peter-evans/create-pull-request@v6\n      with:\n        title: ''mytool ${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}''\n        commit-message: ''Update mytool to ${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}''\n        branch: ''update-mytool-${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}''\n        body: |\n          Automated update for mytool v${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\n          Release: https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/tag/v${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\n\n```text\n\n### winget Manifest Update\n\n```yaml\n\nupdate-winget:\n  needs: release\n  if: ${{ !contains(github.ref_name, ''-'') }}\n  runs-on: windows-latest\n  steps:\n    - name: Extract version\n      id: version\n      shell: bash\n      run: echo \"version=${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n\n    - name: Submit to winget-pkgs\n      uses: vedantmgoyal9/winget-releaser@main\n      with:\n        identifier: MyOrg.MyTool\n        version: ${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\n        installers-regex: ''\\.zip$''\n        token: ${{ secrets.WINGET_GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n\n```text\n\n### Scoop Manifest Update\n\n```yaml\n\nupdate-scoop:\n  needs: release\n  if: ${{ !contains(github.ref_name, ''-'') }}\n  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n  steps:\n    - name: Extract version\n      id: version\n      run: echo \"version=${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n\n    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      with:\n        repository: myorg/scoop-mytool\n        token: ${{ secrets.SCOOP_GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n\n    - name: Download checksums\n      run: |\n        set -euo pipefail\n        curl -sL \"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}/checksums-sha256.txt\" \\\n          -o checksums.txt\n\n    - name: Update manifest\n      run: |\n        set -euo pipefail\n        VERSION=\"${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}\"\n        WIN_X64_SHA=$(grep \"win-x64\" checksums.txt | awk ''{print $1}'')\n\n        # Update bucket/mytool.json with new version and hash\n        jq --arg v \"$VERSION\" --arg h \"$WIN_X64_SHA\" \\\n          ''.version = $v | .architecture.\"64bit\".hash = $h |\n           .architecture.\"64bit\".url = \"https://github.com/myorg/mytool/releases/download/v\\($v)/mytool-\\($v)-win-x64.zip\"'' \\\n          bucket/mytool.json > tmp.json && mv tmp.json bucket/mytool.json\n\n    - name: Create PR\n      uses: peter-evans/create-pull-request@v6\n      with:\n        title: ''mytool ${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}''\n        commit-message: ''Update mytool to ${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}''\n        branch: ''update-mytool-${{ steps.version.outputs.version }}''\n\n```text\n\n---\n\n## Versioning Strategy Details\n\n### SemVer for CLI Tools\n\n| Change Type                      | Version Bump       | Example        |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------ | -------------- |\n| Breaking CLI flag rename/removal | Major              | 1.x.x -> 2.0.0 |\n| New command or option            | Minor              | x.1.x -> x.2.0 |\n| Bug fix, performance improvement | Patch              | x.x.1 -> x.x.2 |\n| Release candidate                | Pre-release suffix | x.x.x-rc.1     |\n\n### Version Embedding\n\nThe version flows from the git tag through `dotnet publish` into the binary:\n\n```xml\n\n<!-- .csproj -- Version is set at publish time via /p:Version -->\n<PropertyGroup>\n  <!-- Fallback version for local development -->\n  <Version>0.0.0-dev</Version>\n</PropertyGroup>\n\n```text\n\n```bash\n\n# --version output matches the git tag\n$ mytool --version\n1.2.3\n\n```bash\n\n### Tagging Workflow\n\n```bash\n\n# 1. Update CHANGELOG.md (if applicable)\n# 2. Commit the changelog\ngit commit -am \"docs: update changelog for v1.2.3\"\n\n# 3. Tag the release\ngit tag -a v1.2.3 -m \"Release v1.2.3\"\n\n# 4. Push tag -- triggers the release workflow\ngit push origin v1.2.3\n\n```text\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Security\n\n### Secret Management\n\n```yaml\n\n# Required repository secrets:\n# NUGET_API_KEY         - NuGet.org API key for package publishing\n# TAP_GITHUB_TOKEN      - PAT with repo scope for homebrew-tap\n# WINGET_GITHUB_TOKEN   - PAT with public_repo scope for winget-pkgs PRs\n# SCOOP_GITHUB_TOKEN    - PAT with repo scope for scoop bucket\n# CHOCO_API_KEY         - Chocolatey API key for package push\n\n```text\n\n### Permissions\n\n```yaml\n\npermissions:\n  contents: write # Minimum: create GitHub Releases and upload assets\n\n```yaml\n\nUse job-level permissions when different jobs need different scopes. Never grant `write-all`.\n\n---\n\n## Agent Gotchas\n\n1. **Do not use `set -e` without `set -o pipefail` in GitHub Actions bash steps.** Without `pipefail`, a failing command\n   piped to `tee` or another utility exits 0, masking the failure. Always use `set -euo pipefail`.\n2. **Do not hardcode the .NET version in the publish path.** Use `dotnet publish -o ./publish` to control the output\n   directory explicitly. Hardcoding `net8.0` in artifact paths breaks when upgrading to .NET 9+.\n3. **Do not skip the pre-release detection step.** Package manager submissions (Homebrew, winget, Scoop, Chocolatey,\n   NuGet) must be gated on stable versions. Publishing a `-rc.1` to winget-pkgs or NuGet as stable causes user\n   confusion.\n4. **Do not use `actions/upload-artifact` v3 with `merge-multiple`.** The `merge-multiple` parameter requires\n   `actions/download-artifact@v4`. Using v3 silently ignores the flag and creates nested directories.\n5. **Do not forget `retention-days: 1` on intermediate build artifacts.** Release artifacts are published to GitHub\n   Releases (permanent). Workflow artifacts are temporary and should expire quickly to save storage.\n6. **Do not create GitHub Releases with `gh release create` in a matrix job.** Only the release job (after all builds\n   complete) should create the release. Matrix jobs upload artifacts; the release job assembles them.\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [GitHub Actions workflow syntax](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/using-workflows/workflow-syntax-for-github-actions)\n- [softprops/action-gh-release](https://github.com/softprops/action-gh-release)\n- [peter-evans/create-pull-request](https://github.com/peter-evans/create-pull-request)\n- [vedantmgoyal9/winget-releaser](https://github.com/vedantmgoyal9/winget-releaser)\n- [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/)\n- [.NET versioning](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/versions/)\n- [GitHub Actions artifacts](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/using-workflows/storing-workflow-data-as-artifacts)\n````\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:54:48.208Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for .NET Developer Agents needing automated release CI/CD pipeline management for .NET CLI tools","zh":"适合于需要自动化发布CI/CD管道管理的.NET开发者代理，特别是用于.NET CLI工具","ja":".NET CLIツールの自動化されたリリースCI/CDパイプライン管理が必要な.NET開発者エージェントに適しています","ko":".NET CLI 도구를 위한 자동화된 릴리스 CI/CD 파이프라인 관리가 필요한 .NET 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador de .NET que necesitan una gestión de tuberías de CI/CD de lanzamiento automatizada para herramientas de .NET CLI","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur .NET nécessitant une gestion de pipeline de release CI/CD automatisée pour les outils .NET CLI","de":"Perfekt für .NET-Entwickler-Agents, die eine automatisierte Release-CI/CD-Pipeline-Verwaltung für .NET-CLI-Tools benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores .NET que necessitam de gerenciamento de pipeline de release CI/CD automatizado para ferramentas .NET CLI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков .NET, которым требуется автоматизированное управление конвейером выпуска CI/CD для инструментов .NET CLI","ar":"مثالي لعميل مطور .NET الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة pipeline إصدار CI/CD أوتوماتيكي لأدوات .NET CLI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate workflows and generate distribution packages using GitHub Actions and .NET 8.0+, creating a unified release pipeline with SemVer versioning strategy, SHA-256 checksums, and automated Homebrew formula and winget manifest PR creation","zh":"赋予代理自动化工作流和使用GitHub Actions及.NET 8.0+生成分发包的能力，创建一个统一的发布管道，采用SemVer版本控制策略、SHA-256校验和，并自动创建Homebrew公式和winget清单PR","ja":"GitHub Actionsおよび.NET 8.0+を使用してワークフローを自動化し、配布パッケージを生成して、SemVerバージョニング戦略、SHA-256チェックサム、HomebrewフォーミュラおよびwingetマニフェストPRの自動作成を含む統一されたリリースパイプラインを作成するエージェントの能力を付与する","ko":"GitHub Actions 및 .NET 8.0+를 사용하여 워크플ロー 자동화 및 배포 패키지 생성을 가능하게 하여, SemVer 버전 관리 전략, SHA-256 체크섬 및 Homebrew 수식 및 winget 매니페스트 PR 자동 생성을 포함한 통일된 릴리스 파이프라인을 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo y generar paquetes de distribución utilizando GitHub Actions y .NET 8.0+, creando una tubería de lanzamiento unificada con estrategia de versionado SemVer, sumas de verificación SHA-256 y creación automática de fórmulas de Homebrew y manifiestos de winget","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail et de générer des packages de distribution en utilisant GitHub Actions et .NET 8.0+, créant une pipeline de release unifiée avec une stratégie de versionning SemVer, des sommes de contrôle SHA-256 et une création automatique de formules Homebrew et de manifestes winget","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Workflows zu automatisieren und Verteilungspakete unter Verwendung von GitHub Actions und .NET 8.0+ zu generieren, wodurch eine einheitliche Release-Pipeline mit SemVer-Versionierungsstrategie, SHA-256-Prüfsummen und automatischer Erstellung von Homebrew-Formeln und winget-Manifesten erstellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho e gerar pacotes de distribuição usando GitHub Actions e .NET 8.0+, criando um pipeline de release unificado com estratégia de versionamento SemVer, checksums SHA-256 e criação automática de fórmula Homebrew e manifesto winget PR","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы и генерировать пакеты распространения с использованием GitHub Actions и .NET 8.0+, создавая унифицированный конвейер выпуска с стратегией версионирования SemVer, хэш-суммами SHA-256 и автоматизированным созданием формулы Homebrew и манифеста winget PR","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من توفير إمكانية تلقائية في سير العمل وتوليد حزم التوزيع باستخدام GitHub Actions و .NET 8.0+، مما يخلق مسار إصدار موحد باستخدام استراتيجية إصدار SemVer و خوارزمية SHA-256 و إنشاء تلقائي لصيغة Homebrew و مаниفست winget PR"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating .NET CLI tool releases with GitHub Actions","Generating distribution packages for multiple Runtime Identifiers (RID)","Creating GitHub Releases with SHA-256 checksums and SemVer versioning","Streamlining Homebrew formula and winget manifest PR creation"],"zh":["使用GitHub Actions自动化.NET CLI工具发布","为多个运行时标识符（RID）生成分发包","使用SHA-256校验和和SemVer版本控制创建GitHub发布","简化Homebrew公式和winget清单PR创建"],"ja":["GitHub Actionsを使用して.NET CLIツールのリリースを自動化する","複数のランタイム識別子（RID）用の配布パッケージを生成する","SHA-256チェックサムおよびSemVerバージョニングを使用してGitHubリリースを作成する","HomebrewフォーミュラおよびwingetマニフェストPRの作成を簡素化する"],"ko":["GitHub Actions를 사용하여 .NET CLI 툴 릴리스 자동화","여러 런타임 식별자(RID)용 배포 패키지 생성","SHA-256 체크섬 및 SemVer 버전 관리를 사용하여 GitHub 릴리스 생성","Homebrew 수식 및 winget 매니페스트 PR 생성 단순화"],"es":["Automatizar los lanzamientos de herramientas de .NET CLI con GitHub Actions","Generar paquetes de distribución para varios Identificadores de Tiempo de Ejecución (RID)","Crear Lanzamientos de GitHub con sumas de verificación SHA-256 y versionado SemVer","Optimizar la creación de fórmulas de Homebrew y manifiestos de winget"],"fr":["Automatiser les sorties d''outils .NET CLI avec GitHub Actions","Générer des packages de distribution pour plusieurs Identificateurs de Runtime (RID)","Créer des Sorties GitHub avec des sommes de contrôle SHA-256 et une version SemVer","Optimiser la création de formules Homebrew et de manifestes winget"],"de":["Automatisieren von .NET-CLI-Tool-Veröffentlichungen mit GitHub Actions","Erstellen von Verteilungspaketen für mehrere Laufzeit-Identifikatoren (RID)","Erstellen von GitHub-Veröffentlichungen mit SHA-256-Prüfsummen und SemVer-Versionierung","Optimieren der Erstellung von Homebrew-Formeln und winget-Manifesten"],"pt":["Automatizar releases de ferramentas .NET CLI com GitHub Actions","Gerar pacotes de distribuição para vários Identificadores de Tempo de Execução (RID)","Criar Releases do GitHub com checksums SHA-256 e versionamento SemVer","Otimizar a criação de fórmula Homebrew e manifesto winget PR"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выпуски инструментов .NET CLI с помощью GitHub Actions","Генерировать пакеты распространения для нескольких идентификаторов среды выполнения (RID)","Создавать выпуски GitHub с хэш-суммами SHA-256 и версионированием SemVer","Оптимизировать создание формулы Homebrew и манифеста winget PR"],"ar":["توفير إمكانية تلقائية لإصدارات أدوات .NET CLI باستخدام GitHub Actions","توليد حزم التوزيع لمعرفات وقت التشغيل المتعددة (RID)","إنشاء إصدارات GitHub بخوارزمية SHA-256 و إصدار SemVer","تسهيل إنشاء صيغة Homebrew و مаниفست winget PR"]},"limitations":{"en":[".NET 8.0+ baseline required","GitHub Actions workflow syntax v2 required","Limited to .NET CLI tools"],"zh":[".NET 8.0+基线版本要求","GitHub Actions工作流语法v2要求","仅限于.NET CLI工具"],"ja":[".NET 8.0+ベースラインが必要","GitHub Actionsワークフローシンタックスv2が必要","CLIツールに限定される"],"ko":[".NET 8.0+ 기준 버전 요구","GitHub Actions 워크플ロー 구문 v2 요구",".NET CLI 툴로 제한됨"],"es":[".NET 8.0+ de línea de base requerida","Sintaxis de flujo de trabajo de GitHub Actions v2 requerida","Limitado a herramientas de .NET CLI"],"fr":[".NET 8.0+ de base requise","Syntaxe de flux de travail GitHub Actions v2 requise","Limité aux outils .NET CLI"],"de":[".NET 8.0+-Baseline erforderlich","GitHub Actions-Workflowsyntax v2 erforderlich","Begrenzt auf .NET-CLI-Tools"],"pt":["Requer baseline .NET 8.0+","Requer sintaxe de workflow GitHub Actions v2","Limitado a ferramentas .NET CLI"],"ru":["Требуется базовая линия .NET 8.0+","Требуется синтаксис рабочего процесса GitHub Actions v2","Ограничен инструментами .NET CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب خط قاعدة .NET 8.0+","يتطلب بنية عمل GitHub Actions v2","محدود بأدوات .NET CLI"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ef54379ae95e58520328630fab5da8bab4ef958521905b2596a4dc73f36d3906","qualityScore":45}');
