hivo docx es un formato de archivo de procesamiento de texto que utiliza un archivo ZIP para almacenar archivos XML y otros recursos.","fr":"Un fichier docx est un format de fichier de traitement de texte qui utilise un fichier ZIP pour stocker des fichiers XML et d''autres ressources.","de":"Eine Datei im docx-Format ist ein Textverarbeitungsdateiformat, das eine ZIP-Datei verwendet, um XML-Dateien und andere Ressourcen zu speichern.","pt":"O que é DOCX? Um formato de arquivo ZIP que contém arquivos XML e outros recursos para criação e edição de documentos","ru":"Что такое DOCX? Формат файла ZIP, содержащий XML-файлы и другие ресурсы для создания и редактирования документов","ar":"ما هو DOCX? تنسيق ملف ZIP يحتوي على ملفات XML وموارد أخرى لإنشاء وتحرير المستندات"},"features":{"en":["Creates new Word documents using specific workflows","Edits and analyzes contents of existing DOCX files","Utilizes Text extraction for reading DOCX content","Employs Raw XML access for advanced DOCX manipulation","Follows a decision tree for determining the optimal workflow"],"zh":["创建新 Word 文档","文本提取","Raw XML 访问","DOCX 文档分析","ZIP圧缩和解压缩"],"ja":["新しい Word ドキュメントの作成","Text extraction","Raw XML access","DOCX ファイルの分析","ZIP圧縮と解凍"],"ko":["새로운 워드 문서 생성","Text extraction","Raw XML access","DOCX 문서 분석","ZIP 압축 및 해제"],"es":["Creación de nuevos documentos de Word","Edición de contenido de archivos docx","Análisis de contenido de archivos docx mediante extracción de texto","Acceso a contenido de archivos docx mediante acceso raw XML","Uso de flujos de trabajo avanzados para la creación y edición de docx"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux documents Word","Édition de contenu de fichiers docx","Analyse de contenu de fichiers docx via l''extraction de texte","Accès au contenu de fichiers docx via l''accès raw XML","Utilisation de flux de travail avancés pour la création et l''édition de docx"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Word-Dokumente","Bearbeitung von Inhalten von docx-Dateien","Analyse von Inhalten von docx-Dateien durch Textextraktion","Zugriff auf Inhalte von docx-Dateien durch raw XML-Zugriff","Verwendung von fortschrittlichen Workflows für die Erstellung und Bearbeitung von docx"],"pt":["Criação de novos documentos DOCX","Edição de arquivos DOCX existentes","Análise de conteúdo de arquivos DOCX","Acesso raw ao XML","Extração de texto de arquivos DOCX"],"ru":["Создание новых документов DOCX","Редактирование существующих файлов DOCX","Анализ содержимого файлов DOCX","Raw-доступ к XML","Экстракция текста из файлов DOCX"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات DOCX جديدة","تحرير ملفات DOCX الحالية","تحليل محتوى ملفات DOCX","دоступ مباشر إلى XML","استخراج النص من ملفات DOCX"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use docx","what is docx","docx alternative","docx vs odt","docx install guide","docx setup for AI agents","creating docx files","editing docx files","analyzing docx content"],"zh":["DOCX 文档创建","DOCX 编辑","DOCX 分析","AI エージェント","Text extraction","Raw XML access","ZIP 压缩","XML 文件","Word 文档"],"ja":["DOCX ファイル作成","DOCX 編集","DOCX 分析","AI エージェント","Text extraction","Raw XML access","ZIP圧縮","XML ファイル","Word ドキュメント"],"ko":["DOCX 문서 생성","DOCX 편집","DOCX 분석","AI 도구","Text extraction","Raw XML access","ZIP 압축","XML 파일","워드 문서"],"es":["agentes de IA y docx","creación de docx","edición de docx","análisis de docx","herramientas de docx para IA","flujos de trabajo de docx","extracción de texto de docx","acceso raw XML de docx"],"fr":["outils d''IA et docx","création de docx","édition de docx","analyse de docx","outils de docx pour l''IA","flux de travail de docx","extraction de texte de docx","accès raw XML de docx"],"de":["künstliche Intelligenz und docx","Erstellung von docx","Bearbeitung von docx","Analyse von docx","Tools für docx und künstliche Intelligenz","Workflows für docx","Textextraktion aus docx","raw XML-Zugriff auf docx"],"pt":["docx","criação de documentos","edição de arquivos","análise de conteúdo","extração de texto","acesso raw ao XML","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["docx","создание документов","редактирование файлов","анализ содержимого","экстракция текста","raw-доступ к XML","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["docx","إنشاء مستندات","تحرير ملفات","تحليل محتوى","استخراج النص","دоступ مباشر إلى XML","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"journey247","repo":"whistle-inn","repoPath":"journey247/whistle-inn","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.808Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docx","description":"Comprehensive document creation, editing, and analysis with support for tracked changes, comments, formatting preservation, and text extraction. When Claude needs to work with professional documents (.docx files) for: (1) Creating new documents, (2) Modifying or editing content, (3) Working with tracked changes, (4) Adding comments, or any other document tasks","bodyPreview":"# DOCX creation, editing, and analysis\n\n## Overview\n\nA user may ask you to create, edit, or analyze the contents of a .docx file. A .docx file is essentially a ZIP archive containing XML files and other resources that you can read or edit. You have different tools and workflows available for different tasks.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n### Reading/Analyzing Content\nUse \"Text extraction\" or \"Raw XML access\" sections below\n\n### Creating New Document\nUse \"Creating a new Word document\" workflow\n\n###","body":"# DOCX creation, editing, and analysis\n\n## Overview\n\nA user may ask you to create, edit, or analyze the contents of a .docx file. A .docx file is essentially a ZIP archive containing XML files and other resources that you can read or edit. You have different tools and workflows available for different tasks.\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n### Reading/Analyzing Content\nUse \"Text extraction\" or \"Raw XML access\" sections below\n\n### Creating New Document\nUse \"Creating a new Word document\" workflow\n\n### Editing Existing Document\n- **Your own document + simple changes**\n  Use \"Basic OOXML editing\" workflow\n\n- **Someone else''s document**\n  Use **\"Redlining workflow\"** (recommended default)\n\n- **Legal, academic, business, or government docs**\n  Use **\"Redlining workflow\"** (required)\n\n## Reading and analyzing content\n\n### Text extraction\nIf you just need to read the text contents of a document, you should convert the document to markdown using pandoc. Pandoc provides excellent support for preserving document structure and can show tracked changes:\n\n```bash\n# Convert document to markdown with tracked changes\npandoc --track-changes=all path-to-file.docx -o output.md\n# Options: --track-changes=accept/reject/all\n```\n\n### Raw XML access\nYou need raw XML access for: comments, complex formatting, document structure, embedded media, and metadata. For any of these features, you''ll need to unpack a document and read its raw XML contents.\n\n#### Unpacking a file\n`python ooxml/scripts/unpack.py <office_file> <output_directory>`\n\n#### Key file structures\n* `word/document.xml` - Main document contents\n* `word/comments.xml` - Comments referenced in document.xml\n* `word/media/` - Embedded images and media files\n* Tracked changes use `<w:ins>` (insertions) and `<w:del>` (deletions) tags\n\n## Creating a new Word document\n\nWhen creating a new Word document from scratch, use **docx-js**, which allows you to create Word documents using JavaScript/TypeScript.\n\n### Workflow\n1. **MANDATORY - READ ENTIRE FILE**: Read [`docx-js.md`](docx-js.md) (~500 lines) completely from start to finish. **NEVER set any range limits when reading this file.** Read the full file content for detailed syntax, critical formatting rules, and best practices before proceeding with document creation.\n2. Create a JavaScript/TypeScript file using Document, Paragraph, TextRun components (You can assume all dependencies are installed, but if not, refer to the dependencies section below)\n3. Export as .docx using Packer.toBuffer()\n\n## Editing an existing Word document\n\nWhen editing an existing Word document, use the **Document library** (a Python library for OOXML manipulation). The library automatically handles infrastructure setup and provides methods for document manipulation. For complex scenarios, you can access the underlying DOM directly through the library.\n\n### Workflow\n1. **MANDATORY - READ ENTIRE FILE**: Read [`ooxml.md`](ooxml.md) (~600 lines) completely from start to finish. **NEVER set any range limits when reading this file.** Read the full file content for the Document library API and XML patterns for directly editing document files.\n2. Unpack the document: `python ooxml/scripts/unpack.py <office_file> <output_directory>`\n3. Create and run a Python script using the Document library (see \"Document Library\" section in ooxml.md)\n4. Pack the final document: `python ooxml/scripts/pack.py <input_directory> <office_file>`\n\nThe Document library provides both high-level methods for common operations and direct DOM access for complex scenarios.\n\n## Redlining workflow for document review\n\nThis workflow allows you to plan comprehensive tracked changes using markdown before implementing them in OOXML. **CRITICAL**: For complete tracked changes, you must implement ALL changes systematically.\n\n**Batching Strategy**: Group related changes into batches of 3-10 changes. This makes debugging manageable while maintaining efficiency. Test each batch before moving to the next.\n\n**Principle: Minimal, Precise Edits**\nWhen implementing tracked changes, only mark text that actually changes. Repeating unchanged text makes edits harder to review and appears unprofessional. Break replacements into: [unchanged text] + [deletion] + [insertion] + [unchanged text]. Preserve the original run''s RSID for unchanged text by extracting the `<w:r>` element from the original and reusing it.\n\nExample - Changing \"30 days\" to \"60 days\" in a sentence:\n```python\n# BAD - Replaces entire sentence\n''<w:del><w:r><w:delText>The term is 30 days.</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:ins><w:r><w:t>The term is 60 days.</w:t></w:r></w:ins>''\n\n# GOOD - Only marks what changed, preserves original <w:r> for unchanged text\n''<w:r w:rsidR=\"00AB12CD\"><w:t>The term is </w:t></w:r><w:del><w:r><w:delText>30</w:delText></w:r></w:del><w:ins><w:r><w:t>60</w:t></w:r></w:ins><w:r w:rsidR=\"00AB12CD\"><w:t> days.</w:t></w:r>''\n```\n\n### Tracked changes workflow\n\n1. **Get markdown representation**: Convert document to markdown with tracked changes preserved:\n   ```bash\n   pandoc --track-changes=all path-to-file.docx -o current.md\n   ```\n\n2. **Identify and group changes**: Review the document and identify ALL changes needed, organizing them into logical batches:\n\n   **Location methods** (for finding changes in XML):\n   - Section/heading numbers (e.g., \"Section 3.2\", \"Article IV\")\n   - Paragraph identifiers if numbered\n   - Grep patterns with unique surrounding text\n   - Document structure (e.g., \"first paragraph\", \"signature block\")\n   - **DO NOT use markdown line numbers** - they don''t map to XML structure\n\n   **Batch organization** (group 3-10 related changes per batch):\n   - By section: \"Batch 1: Section 2 amendments\", \"Batch 2: Section 5 updates\"\n   - By type: \"Batch 1: Date corrections\", \"Batch 2: Party name changes\"\n   - By complexity: Start with simple text replacements, then tackle complex structural changes\n   - Sequential: \"Batch 1: Pages 1-3\", \"Batch 2: Pages 4-6\"\n\n3. **Read documentation and unpack**:\n   - **MANDATORY - READ ENTIRE FILE**: Read [`ooxml.md`](ooxml.md) (~600 lines) completely from start to finish. **NEVER set any range limits when reading this file.** Pay special attention to the \"Document Library\" and \"Tracked Change Patterns\" sections.\n   - **Unpack the document**: `python ooxml/scripts/unpack.py <file.docx> <dir>`\n   - **Note the suggested RSID**: The unpack script will suggest an RSID to use for your tracked changes. Copy this RSID for use in step 4b.\n\n4. **Implement changes in batches**: Group changes logically (by section, by type, or by proximity) and implement them together in a single script. This approach:\n   - Makes debugging easier (smaller batch = easier to isolate errors)\n   - Allows incremental progress\n   - Maintains efficiency (batch size of 3-10 changes works well)\n\n   **Suggested batch groupings:**\n   - By document section (e.g., \"Section 3 changes\", \"Definitions\", \"Termination clause\")\n   - By change type (e.g., \"Date changes\", \"Party name updates\", \"Legal term replacements\")\n   - By proximity (e.g., \"Changes on pages 1-3\", \"Changes in first half of document\")\n\n   For each batch of related changes:\n\n   **a. Map text to XML**: Grep for text in `word/document.xml` to verify how text is split across `<w:r>` elements.\n\n   **b. Create and run script**: Use `get_node` to find nodes, implement changes, then `doc.save()`. See **\"Document Library\"** section in ooxml.md for patterns.\n\n   **Note**: Always grep `word/document.xml` immediately before writing a script to get current line numbers and verify text content. Line numbers change after each script run.\n\n5. **Pack the document**: After all batches are complete, convert the unpacked directory back to .docx:\n   ```bash\n   python ooxml/scripts/pack.py unpacked reviewed-document.docx\n   ```\n\n6. **Final verification**: Do a comprehensive check of the complete document:\n   - Convert final document to markdown:\n     ```bash\n     pandoc --track-changes=all reviewed-document.docx -o verification.md\n     ```\n   - Verify ALL changes were applied correctly:\n     ```bash\n     grep \"original phrase\" verification.md  # Should NOT find it\n     grep \"replacement phrase\" verification.md  # Should find it\n     ```\n   - Check that no unintended changes were introduced\n\n\n## Converting Documents to Images\n\nTo visually analyze Word documents, convert them to images using a two-step process:\n\n1. **Convert DOCX to PDF**:\n   ```bash\n   soffice --headless --convert-to pdf document.docx\n   ```\n\n2. **Convert PDF pages to JPEG images**:\n   ```bash\n   pdftoppm -jpeg -r 150 document.pdf page\n   ```\n   This creates files like `page-1.jpg`, `page-2.jpg`, etc.\n\nOptions:\n- `-r 150`: Sets resolution to 150 DPI (adjust for quality/size balance)\n- `-jpeg`: Output JPEG format (use `-png` for PNG if preferred)\n- `-f N`: First page to convert (e.g., `-f 2` starts from page 2)\n- `-l N`: Last page to convert (e.g., `-l 5` stops at page 5)\n- `page`: Prefix for output files\n\nExample for specific range:\n```bash\npdftoppm -jpeg -r 150 -f 2 -l 5 document.pdf page  # Converts only pages 2-5\n```\n\n## Code Style Guidelines\n**IMPORTANT**: When generating code for DOCX operations:\n- Write concise code\n- Avoid verbose variable names and redundant operations\n- Avoid unnecessary print statements\n\n## Dependencies\n\nRequired dependencies (install if not available):\n\n- **pandoc**: `sudo apt-get install pandoc` (for text extraction)\n- **docx**: `npm install -g docx` (for creating new documents)\n- **LibreOffice**: `sudo apt-get install libreoffice` (for PDF conversion)\n- **Poppler**: `sudo apt-get install poppler-utils` (for pdftoppm to convert PDF to images)\n- **defusedxml**: `pip install defusedxml` (for secure XML parsing)"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:30:25.020Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Document Analysis Agents requiring advanced DOCX file manipulation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级DOCX文件操作能力的文档分析代理。","ja":"文書分析エージェントが高度なDOCXファイル操作機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 DOCX 파일 조작 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Documentos que requieren capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de archivos DOCX.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Documents nécessitant des capacités avancées de manipulation de fichiers DOCX.","de":"Ideal für Dokumentenanalyse-Agents, die erweiterte DOCX-Dateimanipulationsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que exigem capacidades avançadas de manipulação de arquivos DOCX.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Анализа Документов, требующих продвинутых возможностей манипулирования файлами DOCX.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التحليل الوثائقي التي تتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لتعامل مع ملفات DOCX."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, edit, and analyze DOCX files using ZIP archive and XML file manipulation, enabling seamless integration with Microsoft Word documents through text extraction and raw XML access.","zh":"能够赋予代理创建、编辑和分析DOCX文件的能力，使用ZIP存档和XML文件操作，实现与Microsoft Word文档的无缝集成，通过文本提取和原始XML访问。","ja":"ZIPアーカイブとXMLファイル操作を使用して、エージェントがDOCXファイルを作成、編集、分析できるようにし、Microsoft Word文書とのシームレスな統合を実現し、テキスト抽出と生のXMLアクセスを可能にします。","ko":"ZIP 아카이브 및 XML 파일 조작을 사용하여 에이전트가 DOCX 파일을 생성, 편집 및 분석할 수 있도록 하며, Microsoft Word 문서와의 無縫な 통합을 실현하며, 텍스트 추출 및 원시 XML 액세스를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, editar y analizar archivos DOCX utilizando la manipulación de archivos ZIP y XML, lo que permite una integración sin problemas con los documentos de Microsoft Word a través de la extracción de texto y el acceso XML sin procesar.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, d''éditer et d''analyser des fichiers DOCX en utilisant la manipulation de fichiers ZIP et XML, ce qui permet une intégration transparente avec les documents Microsoft Word via l''extraction de texte et l''accès XML brut.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, DOCX-Dateien zu erstellen, zu bearbeiten und zu analysieren, indem sie ZIP-Archiv- und XML-Dateimanipulation verwenden, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Microsoft Word-Dokumenten über Textextraktion und rohen XML-Zugriff ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, editar e analisar arquivos DOCX usando manipulação de arquivos ZIP e XML, permitindo integração transparente com documentos do Microsoft Word por meio de extração de texto e acesso raw XML.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать, редактировать и анализировать файлы DOCX с помощью манипулирования файлами ZIP и XML, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с документами Microsoft Word посредством извлечения текста и прямого доступа к XML.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء وتحرير وتحليل ملفات DOCX باستخدام تعديل أرشيف ZIP وملف XML، وتمكين التكامل السلس مع مستندات مايكروسوفت وورد من خلال استخراج النصوص والوصول المباشر إلى XML."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new Word documents from scratch","Analyzing contents of existing DOCX files","Editing DOCX files using XML file modification"],"zh":["从头开始创建新的Word文档","分析现有DOCX文件的内容","使用XML文件修改编辑DOCX文件"],"ja":["新しいWord文書を最初から作成する","既存のDOCXファイルの内容を分析する","XMLファイルの変更を使用してDOCXファイルを編集する"],"ko":["새로운 워드 문서를 처음부터 생성하는 것","기존 DOCX 파일의 내용을 분석하는 것","XML 파일 수정을 사용하여 DOCX 파일을 편집하는 것"],"es":["Creación de nuevos documentos de Word desde cero","Análisis del contenido de archivos DOCX existentes","Edición de archivos DOCX mediante modificación de archivos XML"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux documents Word à partir de zéro","Analyse du contenu de fichiers DOCX existants","Édition de fichiers DOCX à l''aide de la modification de fichiers XML"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Word-Dokumente von Grund auf","Analyse des Inhalts vorhandener DOCX-Dateien","Bearbeitung von DOCX-Dateien durch XML-Dateimodifikation"],"pt":["Criar novos documentos do Word do zero","Analizar o conteúdo de arquivos DOCX existentes","Editar arquivos DOCX usando modificação de arquivo XML"],"ru":["Создание новых документов Word с нуля","Анализ содержимого существующих файлов DOCX","Редактирование файлов DOCX с помощью модификации файла XML"],"ar":["إنشاء مستندات وورد جديدة من الصفر","تحليل محتويات ملفات DOCX الموجودة","تحرير ملفات DOCX باستخدام تعديل ملف XML"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ZIP archive and XML file parsing capabilities","Limited to DOCX file format"],"zh":["需要ZIP存档和XML文件解析功能","仅限DOCX文件格式"],"ja":["ZIPアーカイブとXMLファイルの解析機能が必要","DOCXファイル形式に限定される"],"ko":["ZIP 아카이브 및 XML 파일 파싱 기능이 필요함","DOCX 파일 형식으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de análisis de archivos ZIP y XML","Limitado al formato de archivo DOCX"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités d''analyse de fichiers ZIP et XML","Limité au format de fichier DOCX"],"de":["Benötigt ZIP-Archiv- und XML-Dateiparsing-Funktionen","Begrenzt auf DOCX-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de análise de arquivos ZIP e XML","Limitado ao formato de arquivo DOCX"],"ru":["Требует возможностей парсинга файлов ZIP и XML","Ограничен форматом файла DOCX"],"ar":["يتطلب إمكانيات تحليل أرشيف ZIP وملف XML","محدود بتنسيق ملف DOCX"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0bd90681fcab2e282025ee14acf508b60bbd6c41ac6c3bf83c0dc14d52c37933","qualityScore":45}');
